  "worked_solution": "First, let's write the sentence more concisely:\n\n\"$x$ is prime and less than $15.$\"\n\nUsing the commutative law, we can swap the order of the words \"prime\" and \"less than $15.$\" The sentence now reads\n\n\"$x$ is less than $15$ and prime.\"",
